  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Woody &amp; Earthy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Set Description: </strong>This wardrobe set features the bestselling Glossier You fragrance alongside Rêve, Doux, and Fleur. Each fragrance comes in an adorable trial size, perfect for discovering your next favorite scent.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>About the Fragrance: </strong>The Glossier You Collection are not scents you wear to become someone else. Instead, all versions of Glossier You perfume are skin-scent enhancers, meaning they smell differently on everyone. With musky, warm Ambrox base notes that wear close to the skin, they let you leave your unique impression.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>This Set Contains:</strong></p><p>- 4 x 0.05 oz/ 1.5 mL fragrances in Glossier You, Glossier You Fleur, Glossier You Doux, Glossier You Réve</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points (neck, behind the ears, wrists, and more).</p><p>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in (as this can disrupt the scent).</p><p>-Apply post-shower, after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Woody &amp; Earthy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Set Description: </strong>This wardrobe set features the bestselling Glossier You fragrance alongside Rêve, Doux, and Fleur. Each fragrance comes in an adorable trial size, perfect for discovering your next favorite scent.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>About the Fragrance: </strong>The Glossier You Collection are not scents you wear to become someone else. Instead, all versions of Glossier You perfume are skin-scent enhancers, meaning they smell differently on everyone. With musky, warm Ambrox base notes that wear close to the skin, they let you leave your unique impression.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>This Set Contains:</strong></p><p>- 4 x 0.05 oz/ 1.5 mL fragrances in Glossier You, Glossier You Fleur, Glossier You Doux, Glossier You Réve</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points (neck, behind the ears, wrists, and more).</p><p>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in (as this can disrupt the scent).</p><p>-Apply post-shower, after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</p></div></details>",
